{"nodes": [{"id": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_doc", "label": "Phase 1 Slice 2 \u2014 Job Queue and Leased Worker", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Turns the synchronous scan into durable per-file jobs drained by a leased worker, so killing the worker mid-scan loses only the files actually in flight. Fourteen tasks."}, {"id": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_pg_jobs", "label": "PgJobs", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every statement the queue issues, plus the PgListener factory. All the queue's SQL lives here because no SQL goes outside lapidary-db \u2014 lapidary-jobs contains not one string of it."}, {"id": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_skip_locked_leasing", "label": "FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED Leasing", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Workers lease rows with FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED so concurrent workers never contend for the same job and losing the race for a file settles as a skip rather than a failure."}, {"id": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_reclamation_without_reaper", "label": "Reclamation Without a Reaper", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reclaiming expired leases is folded into the dequeue statement itself, so there is no reaper process to deploy, supervise, or forget to run. One fewer moving part in an air-gapped deployment."}, {"id": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_listen_notify_poll_floor", "label": "LISTEN/NOTIFY over a Poll Floor", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "LISTEN/NOTIFY wakes the loop early, but the 5-second polling floor is the actual correctness mechanism \u2014 a dropped notification costs latency, not work. A later handoff records that the listener test proved 'an idle loop notices cancellation' rather than 'the poll floor discovers work enqueued while the worker sleeps', which is what this design is about."}, {"id": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_job_handler", "label": "JobHandler", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The seam that exists because of layering: lapidary-jobs is L2 and may not depend on lapidary-cad (L2) or lapidary-ingest (L3). lapidary-jobs owns delivery and policy and never learns what a mesh is; lapidary-ingest implements the trait with slice 1's per-file body."}, {"id": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_next_state", "label": "next_state", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A pure function from (result, attempts) to the next row state. Retry policy lives here and is tested here, without a database or a worker loop."}, {"id": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_batch_id_column", "label": "batch_id as a Column", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One job row per file, grouped by a batch_id that is a column rather than an entity. batch_status counts rows by batch_id with no stored total, so the aggregate is computed rather than cached \u2014 which is what later lets a growing batch work at all."}, {"id": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_crash_resumption", "label": "Crash Resumption", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The slice's whole claim \u2014 killing the worker mid-scan loses nothing but the files actually in flight \u2014 tested as stated end to end, not inferred from unit tests of its parts."}], "edges": [{"source": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_doc", "target": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_pg_jobs", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_skip_locked_leasing", "target": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_pg_jobs", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_reclamation_without_reaper", "target": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_pg_jobs", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_listen_notify_poll_floor", "target": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_pg_jobs", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_batch_id_column", "target": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_pg_jobs", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_next_state", "target": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_pg_jobs", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_crash_resumption", "target": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_pg_jobs", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_job_handler", "target": "plans_2026_09_01_phase_0a_verification_check_layers", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_doc", "target": "plans_2026_09_02_phase_1_slice_1_ingest_doc", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_job_handler", "target": "plans_2026_09_02_phase_1_slice_1_ingest_hash_first", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_doc", "target": "plans_2026_09_02_phase_1_slice_1_ingest_verification_bar", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plans_2026_09_03_phase_1_slice_2_jobs_doc", "target": "plans_2026_09_02_phase_1_slice_1_handoff_migration_rebuild_gap", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-03-phase-1-slice-2-jobs.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}